    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0990_mastiff_01",
      "hash64": "A0687587140BA822",
      "text": "¡Tiff, tiff!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0990_friend_02",
      "hash64": "9C4F5CDF0F4F9C37",
      "text": "¡Epa! ¡Te he dicho que no me eches las patas\\nencima, chico! Se ha puesto como loco al oír\\r\\ntu voz, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0990_friend_03",
      "hash64": "9C4F5BDF0F4F9A84",
      "text": "Bueno, que te llamaba para ver si te acordabas\\nde lo que hablamos acerca de ir al Área Cero.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0990_friend_04a",
      "hash64": "EA70190704407310",
      "text": "Pues claro. ¿Cómo ibas a olvidarte de algo tan\\nimportante?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0990_friend_04b",
      "hash64": "EA701C0704407829",
      "text": "Vaya memoria tienes... ¿No te acuerdas de lo\\nque comentamos en el laboratorio del faro?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0990_friend_05",
      "hash64": "9C4F59DF0F4F971E",
      "text": "Se ve que te has labrado una buena reputación\\ndurante tus aventuras por Paldea...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0990_friend_06",
      "hash64": "9C4F58DF0F4F956B",
      "text": "Gracias a eso, ¡ya tenemos a dos personas\\ndispuestas a ayudarnos con lo del Área Cero![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0990_friend_07",
      "hash64": "9C4F57DF0F4F93B8",
      "text": "Je... No te quejarás, hemos reunido un buen\\nequipo.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0990_friend_08",
      "hash64": "9C4F56DF0F4F9205",
      "text": "Entre los cuatro, el Área Cero será un paseo.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0990_friend_09",
      "hash64": "9C4F55DF0F4F9052",
      "text": "En fin, mejor lo hablamos en persona.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0990_friend_10",
      "hash64": "9C4BD8DF0F4C8614",
      "text": "Te esperaremos en la Puerta Cero. Te mando la\\nubicación exacta. Y ven pitando, a ser posible.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0990_friend_11",
      "hash64": "9C4BD9DF0F4C87C7",
      "text": "¡No hagas que nos salgan telarañas de esperar![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
